WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:03.899
SCP-035 Vs SCP-999.

00:00:03.899 --> 00:00:08.709
Who would win, this incredibly malicious mask
or the incredibly kind and lovable Tickle

00:00:08.709 --> 00:00:09.709
Monster?

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:11.040
Let’s find out.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.910
SCP-035 is an undeniably powerful foe.

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:18.609
From its caustic black liquid, to the incredibly
compelling mental energy that it unleashes

00:00:18.609 --> 00:00:21.289
to convince its unwitting victims to put it
on.

00:00:21.289 --> 00:00:23.499
But what would this power do against SCP-999?

00:00:23.499 --> 00:00:28.949
Being a living blob, it doesn’t have a fixed
face in the traditional sense.

00:00:28.949 --> 00:00:34.120
As a result, it may be difficult for 035 to
bond with 999 and thus take it over.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:38.670
We also believe it’s equally possible that
the powerful good vibes of 999 could counteract

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:41.760
the mental control of SCP-035.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:46.570
And if it can truly reverse this polarity,
perhaps the nasty mask would chill out for

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:47.190
once.

